        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Hits have a chance to give the target a permanent Slowness stack, stacking to Slowness III on repeat hits on the same target; more hits raise the chance (1%->2%->4%->8% cap).",
            "zh_cn": "命中有概率为目标施加一层永久缓慢效果，重复命中同一目标可叠加至缓慢 III。踢中得越多，概率越高（1%→2%→4%→8% 封顶）",
